**Vanilla Changes**

- Stone tools are replaced with the newly added copper gear
- Rose gold gear was added
- Each armor set has special effects
- Ore generation has been changed
- No more "too expensive" when using an anvil
- Mending is now removed and replaced with the new reforming enchantment
- The enchanting system has been overhauled
![new enchanting table](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/08cb99a2beb3ed9317ba49a4a688adc0898e33a2.jpeg)
- The recipe book was added to other functional blocks
- Added everything from future versions
- Archeology was improved
- The fletching table was overhauled
![Fletching table](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ce028a273af6ed82ecb48a281490a8ad51c1dd33.jpeg)
- Mob AI was changed and improved
- Minecarts are now faster and load chunks
- You can right-click to harvest crops
- The Elder Guardian, Warden, Wither, and the Ender Dragon are now stronger and improved with new loot
- New map with the newly added atlas
- Fishing is now better and overhauled
![fishing](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/38e4739d6fdef9173d1dac8a15f2cbc2a9fa288e.jpeg)
- Durability of all items is changed
- Villagers have additional trades
- The Overworld, the Nether, and the End are now overhauled and have new structures
- Potion effect time now stacks
